# In-app modals only (no browser popups)

Never use `window.confirm`, `window.alert`, or `window.prompt`.

For confirms, warnings, and destructive actions, use the shared `ConfirmDialog`
(`src/components/confirm-dialog.tsx`) or the same portal pattern as song add/edit:

- `fixed inset-0` overlay + `createPortal(..., document.body)`
- Center with `place-items-center` (never `place-items-end` / bottom-sheet for dialogs)
- Rounded card (`rounded-2xl` admin / `rounded-3xl` paper)
- Title + short description + Cancel / Confirm pill buttons
- `surface="admin"` on dashboard; `surface="paper"` on guest request flow

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
window.confirm("Are you sure you want to log out?");

 // ✅ GOOD
<ConfirmDialog
  open={confirmLogout}
  title="Log out?"
  description="Are you sure you want to log out?"
  confirmLabel="Log out"
  cancelLabel="Stay signed in"
  onConfirm={() => void logout()}
  onCancel={() => setConfirmLogout(false)}
/>
```

Also documented in `.cursorrules` under Modals.
